WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.586
Danny: Who are you?

2
00:00:12.587 --> 00:00:14.161
Hopian: It’s all right.

3
00:00:14.162 --> 00:00:17.263
There’s nothing to be afraid of.

4
00:00:17.264 --> 00:00:19.364
Danny: What are you doing here?

5
00:00:19.365 --> 00:00:22.038
Hopian: My name is Hopian, Danny.

6
00:00:22.039 --> 00:00:24.563
Danny: How do you know my name?

7
00:00:24.564 --> 00:00:27.265
Hopian: I’ve been watching you.

8
00:00:27.266 --> 00:00:29.616
Danny: Watching me? Why?

9
00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:32.763
Hopian: Only you can help us, Danny.

10
00:00:32.764 --> 00:00:35.272
I come from Ginormous.

11
00:00:35.274 --> 00:00:40.271
Hopian: It’s a land filled with giants like myself.

12
00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:45.507
Hopian: The people of Ginormous were usually very happy.

13
00:00:45.508 --> 00:00:48.461
Hopian: We all got along with each other.

14
00:00:48.462 --> 00:00:51.136
We knew how to play.

15
00:00:51.137 --> 00:00:56.012
Hopian: Families used to gather for picnics in the colorful gardens.

16
00:00:56.013 --> 00:01:00.217
Hopian: The giant children used to sing and paint pictures.

17
00:01:00.218 --> 00:01:04.103
Hopian: My son used to make clay castles.

18
00:01:04.104 --> 00:01:07.047
Danny: Sounds like fun! What happened?

19
00:01:07.048 --> 00:01:09.898
Hopian: Our color is disappearing, Danny.

20
00:01:09.899 --> 00:01:11.822
Danny: What do you mean?

21
00:01:11.823 --> 00:01:14.930
Hopian: I noticed it about a month ago.

22
00:01:14.931 --> 00:01:19.321
Hopian: I went outside one day to get ready for a party.

23
00:01:19.322 --> 00:01:23.161
Hopian: Our friends and neighbors were going to join us.

24
00:01:23.162 --> 00:01:28.393
Hopian: I looked around the garden, and then I noticed something.

25
00:01:28.394 --> 00:01:32.820
Hopian: I walked up to a plant that was normally bright blue.

26
00:01:32.821 --> 00:01:35.538
Hopian: But now it was gray!

27
00:01:35.539 --> 00:01:38.424
I bent down to look at the grass.

28
00:01:38.425 --> 00:01:41.353
Hopian: I noticed that it had faded too.

29
00:01:41.354 --> 00:01:45.966
Hopian: I was surprised, and started to feel sad.

30
00:01:45.967 --> 00:01:48.116
Danny: That’s terrible!

31
00:01:48.117 --> 00:01:53.291
Hopian: As the weeks passed, I noticed more and more gray.

32
00:01:53.292 --> 00:01:56.692
Hopian: My friends were no longer very happy.

33
00:01:56.693 --> 00:02:00.451
People seemed to change.

34
00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:03.972
Hopian: Something evil is happening to my world.

35
00:02:03.973 --> 00:02:06.866
Hopian: My people are very sad.

36
00:02:06.867 --> 00:02:10.448
They miss color.

37
00:02:10.449 --> 00:02:13.008
That’s why I came to you.

38
00:02:13.009 --> 00:02:14.548
Danny: Why me?

39
00:02:14.549 --> 00:02:19.550
Hopian: Everyone in Ginormous is forgetting all about color.

40
00:02:19.551 --> 00:02:23.581
Hopian: But you still have a colorful imagination.

41
00:02:23.582 --> 00:02:25.425
Danny: But what can I do?

42
00:02:25.426 --> 00:02:28.696
I’m just a little kid.
